# Exceptions for the Trivy scan (.github/trivy-scan.sh) – only for findings that were checked and
# provably cannot be exploited in AssetLotse. Each entry needs, checked automatically:
#   - a reason on the line directly above, starting with "# reason:"
#   - an expiry date (exp:YYYY-MM-DD); after it the finding is reported again and checked anew
# Example:
#   # reason: affects only the XYZ parser, which AssetLotse never calls (checked 2026-10-25)
#   CVE-2026-12345 exp:2027-01-31
